</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3>Evidence</h3>
<p>
Can an employer inspect something you created?
</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3>Communication</h3>
<p>
Can you clearly explain your decisions, process, and results?
</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3>Professionalism</h3>
<p>
Can you meet deadlines, follow instructions, organize work,
