<li>No legitimate company website</li>
<li>Poor or inconsistent communication</li>
<li>Pressure to act immediately</li>
<li>Requests for sensitive information too early</li>
<li>Requests to purchase equipment through an unknown seller</li>
<li>Requests to deposit or transfer money on behalf of an employer</li>
</ul>

</div>

